      "id": "claim_9a6c39a3cc0a4df1ae5b1c7b340aea6d",
      "statement": "The llm group provides the harness's model-call capability: one provider-neutral service through which any composition streams requests to a model provider, plus adapters, provider-specific request metadata, retry execution, and measurement; the core llm package defines the message, content-block, and stream-chunk vocabulary every plugin and the session log use.",
      "evidence": [
